  {
    "episode_id": 96118,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/9/6/96118.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 5,
    "turn_text": "Thank you, Marcus. Great to be with you as always. And we are holding up. You know, and I hope all of your viewers and you and your family are well. You know, it's a tough time. And certainly I can speak for myself and say that I do realize all the blessings that I have when I look at how many folks are suffering so immensely. So all is good. And I have not gone home to California. I stayed in DC to keep fighting on what we need to get in terms of these relief packages. So that's where you find me today.",
