        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker has moral authority and responsibility to advocate for vulnerable populations.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "Without intentional design, new technologies like vaccines will replicate existing structural inequities.",
        "confidence": 0.9
